WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:02.794
Everybody's gone!

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:09.176
Honey, this summer&nbsp;
is gonna be great.

00:00:10.219 --> 00:00:11.678
You're going to make friends.

00:00:11.762 --> 00:00:13.222
There's nothing
to worry about.

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:16.016
Welcome to&nbsp;
the Rim of the World

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:17.392
Adventure&nbsp;Camp.

00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:19.353
Alex, I am your leader, Logan.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.522
-I love you.
-Mom!

00:00:25.651 --> 00:00:27.444
Zhenzhen!
Where are you going?

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:29.613
I don't think we should
wander this far.

00:00:29.905 --> 00:00:31.114
Maybe we should head back?

00:00:31.949 --> 00:00:32.783
Follow me.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:37.371
What was that?

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:42.501
Never seen&nbsp;
anything like them.

00:00:42.751 --> 00:00:44.253
It's Independence Day.

00:00:44.336 --> 00:00:45.754
It's June, Gabriel!

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:47.923
We need to wait here until
the adults realize they left us.

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:51.176
Go! Run!

00:00:53.345 --> 00:00:54.763
Did you see&nbsp;
the size of that thing?

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:01.436
Stop talking.

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:02.521
Please stop.

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:05.023
Was that an alien?

00:01:05.607 --> 00:01:06.567
Let's go!

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.152
It has the dog!

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:11.822
We need to find our parents.

00:01:12.864 --> 00:01:13.949
We got to get to the city.

00:01:15.284 --> 00:01:16.201
Do not move!

00:01:16.827 --> 00:01:18.453
We're at war.
You're not safe here.

00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:24.876
-You'd better go.
-We can't leave you!

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:25.877
Take this key.

00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:27.004
It's on you now.

00:01:28.964 --> 00:01:29.798
This is a cryptokey.

00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:32.259
It can activate&nbsp;
our satellite defense.

00:01:33.135 --> 00:01:34.636
We should try to find JPL.

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:36.930
It's a NASA facility
70 miles away from here.

00:01:37.306 --> 00:01:38.890
How are we supposed to go
70 miles?

00:01:41.435 --> 00:01:43.729
1973 Ford Mustang Mach 1.

00:01:47.858 --> 00:01:48.900
I can't drive a stick.

00:01:50.819 --> 00:01:52.738
-Yeah, Zhenzhen!
-Hold on tight!

00:02:00.329 --> 00:02:01.663
This is Animal Kingdom&nbsp;here.

00:02:02.748 --> 00:02:04.666
-Hang on!
-We have each other.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:07.085
And we can't give up now.

00:02:09.212 --> 00:02:10.631
I'm your master now.

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:12.716
No, the line is,

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:14.593
"Now I am the master."

00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:16.428
Okay, we really need
to get you a girl.

00:02:24.227 --> 00:02:25.228
May I propose a toast?

00:02:25.771 --> 00:02:28.106
Crap! This is from 1969.

00:02:28.231 --> 00:02:29.316
At least get fresh wine

00:02:29.399 --> 00:02:31.109
if this is gonna be&nbsp;
my first time, right?

